Core Features:
GPS-Denied Navigation: Operates without GNSS using onboard vision-based localization
Visual Odometry: Estimates drone motion using sequential image frames
Real-Time Processing: High-performance inference on Jetson Orin Nano
Autonomous Maneuvering: Position control using NED frame transformations
Flight Controller Integration: Seamless communication between Jetson and Pixhawk using MAVLink


Technical Approach:
1. Visual Based Localization
Captured real-time video feed from onboard camera
Applied computer vision techniques (OpenCV) for feature detection and tracking
Estimated motion using frame-to-frame displacement (visual odometry)

2. Coordinate Transformation
Converted visual displacement into NED coordinate system
Enabled consistent motion planning relative to drone orientation

3. Control Pipeline
Generated velocity/position setpoints from perception output
Sent commands to Pixhawk via MAVLink protocol
Enabled closed-loop control for stable navigation

4. Companion Computer Integration
Jetson Orin Nano handled:
  Image processing
  Localization logic
  High-level decision making
Pixhawk handled:
  Low-level stabilization
  Motor control
